# Processing Modules (Docker)

- One **dedicated image** per module; prefer **community images** (FSL, ANTs, FreeSurfer, fMRIPrep-style) when licenses allow.
- Custom images: `docker/<tool-name>/` with `Dockerfile`, pinned base, README (I/O, BIDS paths, env vars).
- **Contract:** mount BIDS paths as volumes; config via env or small JSON — not ad-hoc host paths.
- Log to stdout/stderr; record exit code and run metadata under `derivatives/`.
- Orchestrate from a thin service layer — **no heavy compute inside FastAPI**.
